[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17889.03, "timestamp": "04:58:09", "text": "反抗嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17889.59, "timestamp": "04:58:09", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17892.31, "timestamp": "04:58:12", "text": "呃，不。  我這就把你調到這裡來"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17900.788, "timestamp": "04:58:20", "text": "哦，對。哦，是的。坐著。好的。  把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17920.788, "timestamp": "04:58:40", "text": "它撤下來。你被推到這裡來了，就在那個運動健將面前。從"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17922.788, "timestamp": "04:58:42", "text": "這裡開始，情況會變得更糟。  它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17930.15, "timestamp": "04:58:50", "text": "移動了 30 英尺。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17933.83, "timestamp": "04:58:53", "text": "五。然後就是這樣。  15 16. 然後，呃，等等。不是50，而是20、25，然後是30。好的。"}]